Z||000000||anthony_86gt||02-15-2001||06:19 PM||||I have a red 86gt.  On the back, the plastic piece on the bottom looks dull. If you guys can help me tell me what to use to shine it up!! Please help, thanks.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Oreif||02-15-2001||06:56 PM||||Go buy Meguires 3-step system.<BR>It has 3 maroon bottles with numbers.<BR>1 is the paint cleaner. Removes scratches and minor fading.<BR>2 is the Deep Crystal Polish. polishes the surface of the paint for a deep gloss shine.<BR>3 is the Carnuba Wax to protect the shine and finish.<BR> Works Great! my car is 90% original paint and it shines like glass.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/gallery/Cars/Fwall.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 02-15-2001).]||||reg||1
